<DocLayout
  title="Privacy Policy · Little App Co Publisher"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Little App Co Publisher, a private tool that posts Little App Co's own videos."
  eyebrow="Little App Co"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  meta="Last updated: September 27, 2026"
  noindex
>
  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Summary:</strong> The Little App Co Publisher is a private tool used only by its owner to
    post Little App Co's own promotional videos to its own accounts. It does not collect information
    about anyone else.
  </div>

  <h2>Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    This policy covers the <strong>Little App Co Publisher</strong>, operated by Matt Donders. It
    schedules and publishes short videos about Little App Co's iPhone apps to the
    <strong>@littleappco</strong> accounts on YouTube, Instagram and TikTok, and reads those posts'
    public performance numbers (views, likes, saves). It is not offered to the public and no other
    users sign in to it. Each app has its own privacy policy, linked from its page on
    <a href="/apps">mattdonders.com/apps</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>No personal information about other people.</strong> The Publisher only accesses the
    owner's own Little App Co accounts. It does not read other people's profiles, messages, comments,
    or contacts, and it does not track viewers.
  </p>

  <h2>Google User Data (YouTube)</h2>
  <p>The Publisher uses Google OAuth to access the owner's own Little App Co YouTube channel with two permissions:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>youtube.upload</code>: to upload and schedule Little App Co's videos.</li>
    <li><code>youtube.readonly</code>: to confirm which channel it is connected to and to read view
      and like counts for the videos it uploaded.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The Publisher's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs adheres to the
    <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
    including the Limited Use requirements. Uploaded videos are subject to the
    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube Terms of Service</a>
    and the
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
    Access can be revoked at any time from
    <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Account permissions</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Instagram and TikTok</h2>
  <p>
    Instagram posting uses Meta's Graph API with access limited to the Little App Co Facebook Page and
    its linked Instagram account. TikTok posting goes through Zernio, a posting service, for the
    @littleappco TikTok account only. Posts are subject to Meta's and TikTok's own terms and privacy
    policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Storage and Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    Access tokens are stored on a private computer with restricted access and are used only for the
    purposes above. Videos are staged briefly on Cloudflare R2 so the platforms can fetch them. Tokens
    and data are never sold, shared with third parties for their own use, placed in a public
    repository, or used for advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>Any changes to this policy will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy can be sent to
    <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Little%20App%20Co%20Publisher%20Privacy">matt@mattdonders.com</a>.
  </p>
</DocLayout>
